config MYRON_MCA_READONLY
    tristate "Myron independent read-only MCA telemetry (compile qualification only)"
    depends on OF && SYSFS && QTI_PMIC_GLINK
    default n
    help
      Compile an independent opt-in diagnostic client with a fixed read-only
      property allowlist. This does not enable charging policies, replace
      power_supply reporting or install any module on a device.
